{
  "version": "1.27.0",
  "type": "session",
  "createdWith": "Lumina",
  "comments": "Ouvrir avec Open Stage Control (client) sur iPad, ou servir via open-stage-control. Destination OSC = IP du PC Lumina, port 9000 UDP. Adresses /lumina/pad/N et /lumina/panic.",
